        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria! How is it looking?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on just a little longer! Let me get this last screw!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tighten it up! Really get it in there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it! Wait, hold on! I think I know what's wrong with the battery slot connection down here\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up! You know how heavy the jukebox is! I can't hold it much longer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your cheese, V.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...This isn't going to blow up on us like last time now, is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A jukebox blowing up? That would be quite a sight to behold.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How can you be sure it won't happen? If it's got something to do with Originium, Kowal will find a way to mess it up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_101#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's talking behind my back?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Master Kowal! C-Careful! Stop shaking it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ughh, my bad. Sorry, Maria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_101#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "V! Once I'm done over here, I'm going to teach you a lesson!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, I'll be waiting!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can always count on you two to liven things up here. Just remember, if you end up fighting, anything you break, you'll have to pay for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You've heard him babble on and on like that for years, but when did you ever see him win?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He handed you your behind just the other day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... I was drunk last time. Plus, I had arthritis... That didn't count!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Chugging intensifies*\u2014Hah! When we made that trip to the borderlands back in the day, he wouldn't dare talk to me like this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_101#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "V! What kind of lies are you on about this time?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You followed me to that hellhole! Who were you, if not just a affinity?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_101#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was years ago! All of your affinities made it big enough to be your king by now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
